# Penalty Shootout (Vite + TypeScript) - Updated

This branch adds: 
- Shooter AI (AI takes penalties with strategy)
- Animated low-poly player and goalkeeper animations
- MediaRecorder-based replay export (webm) and in-game replay gallery
- Procedural/offline crowd texture and animated UV scrolling
- Polished league progression UI (tier, points, trophies)

Run locally:

1) npm install
2) npm run dev

Notes:
- MediaRecorder requires browser support; exported replays are WEBM. You can download them from the Replays panel.
- Audio is synthesized via WebAudio and will require a user gesture to start in some browsers.
